 <body><div id="game"><div class="shade"></div><div id="hud"><div class="topbar"><div class="brand">DUSTBOUND<small>THE FRONTIER, 1898</small></div><button class="menu-toggle" id="pauseButton" aria-label="Pause game">Ⅱ</button></div><div class="mission"><b id="missionTitle">THE LOST SUPPLY</b><span id="missionText">Find the courier's scattered satchels</span></div><div class="counter" id="counter"><strong id="count">0</strong>/5 SATCHELS</div><div class="compass">N <i>◆</i> &nbsp; <span id="compassText">FOLLOW THE GOLDEN GLOW</span></div><div class="hint" id="hint"></div><div class="toast" id="toast"></div><div class="reticle"></div></div><div class="touch"><div class="stick" id="stick"><div class="nub" id="nub"></div></div><div class="mobile-tip">DRAG RIGHT SIDE TO LOOK</div><div class="look" id="look"></div><div class="buttons"><button class="action" id="walk"><span>◌</span>WALK</button><button class="action" id="switch"><span>⇄</span>SWITCH</button><button class="action main" id="gallop"><span>♞</span>GALLOP</button><button class="action" id="mount"><span>↟</span>DISMOUNT</button></div></div><div class="intro" id="intro"><div class="card"><div class="eyebrow">A small frontier tale</div><h1>The Lost<br>Supply</h1><p>A courier's been waylaid on the trail to Coyote Creek. The medicine and provisions are scattered across the valley—and the sun won't wait.</p><div class="objective"><b>YOUR TASK</b><br>Ride out and recover all <b>5 supply satchels</b>. Follow their warm golden glimmer. Ride close to collect them.</div><button class="start" id="start">START YOUR STORY&nbsp; →</button><button class="menu-link" id="showControls">CONTROLS & OPTIONS</button><p class="tiny">An open frontier adventure · autosaves are not required</p></div></div><div class="pause-screen hide" id="pauseMenu"><div class="card"><div class="eyebrow">Take a breather</div><h1>Paused</h1><p>Your trail is waiting, partner.</p><button class="start" id="resume">BACK TO THE TRAIL</button><button class="menu-link" id="pauseControls">CONTROLS & OPTIONS</button><button class="menu-link" id="returnTitle">RETURN TO MAIN MENU</button></div></div><div class="options-screen hide" id="options"><div class="card"><div class="eyebrow">Frontier field guide</div><h1>Controls</h1><div class="objective"><b>KEYBOARD</b><br>WASD / arrows — move and steer<br>Shift — gallop · Space — jump on foot<br>E — mount or dismount · Q — switch character<br>Esc / P — pause</div><div class="objective"><b>TOUCH</b><br>Left stick — move · drag right side — look<br>GALLOP / WALK · MOUNT · SWITCH</div><button class="start" id="closeOptions">BACK</button></div></div><div class="finish hide" id="finish"><div class="card"><div class="eyebrow">Coyote Creek remembers</div><h1>Good work,<br>partner.</h1><p>You brought the courier's supplies home before sundown. The town owes you one.</p><button class="start" id="again">RIDE AGAIN&nbsp; ↺</button></div></div></div>
