 <body><div id="game"><div class="shade"></div><div id="hud"><div class="topbar"><div class="brand">DUSTBOUND<small>THE FRONTIER, 1898</small></div><div class="top-actions"><button class="menu-toggle" id="mapButton" aria-label="Open map" title="Map (M)">⌖</button><button class="menu-toggle" id="pauseButton" aria-label="Pause game">Ⅱ</button></div></div><div class="mission"><b id="missionTitle">THE MARKED COACH</b><span id="missionText">Stay close to the marked vehicle</span></div><div class="counter" id="counter"><strong id="count">0</strong>% ESCORT<div class="follow-bar"><i id="followBar"></i></div></div><div class="compass">N <i>◆</i> &nbsp; <span id="compassText">FOLLOW THE GOLD MARKER</span></div><div class="hint" id="hint"></div><div class="toast" id="toast"></div><div class="reticle"></div></div><div class="touch"><div class="stick" id="stick"><div class="nub" id="nub"></div></div><div class="mobile-tip">DRAG RIGHT SIDE TO LOOK</div><div class="look" id="look"></div><div class="buttons"><button class="action" id="walk"><span>◌</span>WALK</button><button class="action" id="switch"><span>⇄</span>SWITCH</button><button class="action main" id="gallop"><span>♞</span>GALLOP</button><button class="action" id="mount"><span>↟</span>DISMOUNT</button></div></div><div class="intro" id="intro"><div class="card"><div class="eyebrow">A new trail through the frontier</div><h1>The Marked<br>Coach</h1><p>A suspicious stagecoach is crossing the valley. Keep the marked vehicle in sight and ride with it until you learn where it is headed.</p><div class="objective"><b>YOUR TASK</b><br>Stay within range of the gold-marked coach to complete the escort. The sheriff will pay you <b>$5,000</b>.</div><button class="start" id="start">START THE MISSION&nbsp; →</button><button class="menu-link" id="showControls">CONTROLS & OPTIONS</button><p class="tiny">An open frontier adventure · autosaves are not required</p></div></div><div class="pause-screen hide" id="pauseMenu"><div class="card"><div class="eyebrow">Take a breather</div><h1>Paused</h1><p>Your trail is waiting, partner.</p><button class="start" id="resume">BACK TO THE TRAIL</button><button class="menu-link" id="pauseControls">CONTROLS & OPTIONS</button><button class="menu-link" id="returnTitle">RETURN TO MAIN MENU</button></div></div><div class="options-screen hide" id="options"><div class="card"><div class="eyebrow">Frontier field guide</div><h1>Controls</h1><div class="objective"><b>KEYBOARD</b><br>WASD / arrows — move and steer<br>Shift — gallop · Space — jump on foot<br>E — mount or dismount · Q — switch character<br>M — map · Esc / P — pause</div><div class="objective"><b>TOUCH</b><br>Left stick — move · drag right side — look<br>GALLOP / WALK · MOUNT · SWITCH</div><button class="start" id="closeOptions">BACK</button></div></div><div class="map-screen hide" id="mapScreen" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="mapTitle"><div class="map-panel"><div class="map-head"><div><h2 id="mapTitle">LOS SANTOS · FIELD MAP</h2><p>SELECT A LOCATION · THE GOLD MARKER TRACKS YOUR TARGET</p></div><button class="map-close" id="closeMap" aria-label="Close map">CLOSE ✕</button></div><div class="map-layout"><div><div class="map-art" id="mapArt" aria-label="Illustrated map with marked locations"></div><div class="map-legend"><span>Marked vehicle</span><span class="player-key">You</span></div></div><div class="map-side"><div class="map-list" id="mapList"></div><div class="map-detail" id="mapDetail" aria-live="polite"><b>Los Santos</b>Choose a place to see its type and coordinates.</div></div></div><p class="map-foot">Map locations follow your Lua example. Los Santos is an illustrated regional map; the playable 3D world remains the Coyote Creek frontier.</p></div></div><div class="finish hide" id="finish"><div class="card"><div class="eyebrow">Coyote Creek remembers</div><h1>Good work,<br>partner.</h1><p>You kept the coach in sight and brought the sheriff's target home. Your reward: <b>$5,000</b>.</p><button class="start" id="again">RIDE AGAIN&nbsp; ↺</button></div></div></div>
